# Repeat

Use this skill to rerun the last failed or incomplete workflow step with updated context.

## Protocol

1. Read `.ai/context/current.md`.
2. Read `PROGRESS::ISSUE-ID` if it exists.
3. Re-run only the missing step and its relevant verification.
